  "description": "Experience complex operations out of the iconic Dresden Hbf, with passengers converging to make a hustle and bustle mix of S-Bahn, regional, inter-city, and freight traffic. Be in control of modern traction and explore the countryside of Train Sim World®: Nahverkehr Dresden - Riesa.\n\nDating back to the 1830s, the line between Dresden and Riesa was one of Germany’s first long-distance railways. Today the line’s importance keeps it busy, fast services beat the regional traffic through the use of separate fast and slow lines that each take a different path through the Saxony countryside, and the outskirts of Dresden are served by frequent commuter services."
